<task id="022b" project="field-mapping-server-write-path-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Mapping from a Restricted source; a document's access permission set in the create (UAC-r2 2026-11-08)</title>
    <phase>3 W3 Wizards (follow-up to 022 fix round 2)</phase>
    <gate>022 fix round 2 (the secure-source owner invariant) merged into the work branch first: both edit RecordCreationService and its mapping step. UAC-r2 reviews the diff before merge.</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Changes what a create maps and what it writes for access permission (.cs, bff-api); access-rule adjacent.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Per-table access rules and fail-closed reasoning across the create steps.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
